      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it's really hard to sleep with this pain. i looked it up online and people say tramadol is pretty standard. im not trying to get high or anything, i just need the pain to stop so i can function. is there like a specific dose that is safe enough that i won't have a reaction? like if i just took a small amount it would be fine right?",
